        <item>
            <title>1.5.15</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 00:59:49 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>47</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.15</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Roomier file list, Windows Explorer-style.</b> The List and Details views now use taller rows with slightly larger text and icons, matching the airier feel of Windows 11 File Explorer's details view — this is the new default. Prefer the previous tighter look? Toggle <b>Compact View</b> in the toolbar's View menu (next to Show Hidden Files), just like Windows 11's Compact view. The choice applies to every window and tab, persists across launches, and never touches your per-folder view modes. Icon views, the sidebar, and Gallery are unchanged.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
